# Knowledge Base

- `docs/kb/` is canonical agent memory — prefer it over chat folklore.
- When changing scoring, APIs, routes, deploy, or scope: update the matching kb page.
- Keep pages short and linked; deep narrative stays in existing `docs/*.md`.
- Index: `docs/kb/README.md`. Routing: `docs/kb/AGENT_ROUTING.md`.
